<!--
  Main dashboard (UI-1 rework) — LIVE: MainActivity.setContentView.

  UI-1 changes (base 88e42550):
  - Header centred: "SPLENDOR" / "SPLENDOR ASSIST" (was "SPLENDOR ASSIST
    2027", left-aligned). Subtitle kept.
  - Start/Stop buttons use button_dashboard_filled / button_dashboard_ghost
    (8dp corners, same premium gradient) instead of the 27dp pill.
    button_premium / btn_ghost (used by the control rooms) untouched.
  - The raw monospace key=value dump (txtRuntimeHub) is GONE. In its place
    five design banners — RUNTIME, HEALTH, REGISTRY, FRAME, DECISION —
    each followed by a bulb grid that MainActivity fills from the SAME live
    snapshots the dump used (RuntimeCoordinator.runtimeState,
    RuntimeHealthMonitor.runtimeHealthSnapshot, GameplayEngineRegistry.
    registryRuntimeSnapshot, FrameAssembler.frameRuntimeSnapshot,
    RuntimeDecisionLoop.decisionRuntimeSnapshot). Bulb colours: true/alive
    = green, false/waiting = yellow, issue = red. Counters live inside
    their bulb. (UI-3 added FRAME + DECISION; CONTRIBUTIONS, EXECUTION,
    CONTROL MAPPING and EVENTS are the next piece.)
  - Duplicate room cards REMOVED: cardNotifications (same destination as
    cardAccessibility -> AgentHub) and cardDiagnostics (same destination as
    cardOverlay -> GameplayRoom). One card per room.
  - Future Rooms card is now a Settings card (opens FutureRoomsActivity
    for now; the full Settings page is a later piece).
  - The monospace runtimeStatusCard is gone — its three lines are covered
    by the RUNTIME / HEALTH bulbs.
  - Edge-to-edge: the root ScrollView is dashboardRoot; MainActivity applies
    the system-bars insets to it so content is never hidden behind the
    status / navigation bars (targetSdk 36 enforces edge-to-edge).
  - Degradation-reasons design is intentionally NOT built here — Ed is
    still thinking of a way to design it.
  Colours stay theme tokens (no60 rule); no hex colour in this file.
-->
<ScrollView xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    android:id="@+id/dashboardRoot"
    android:layout_width="match_parent" android:layout_height="match_parent"
    android:background="?android:attr/colorBackground" android:fillViewport="true" android:overScrollMode="never">
  <com.google.android.material.card.MaterialCardView
      android:tag="PHASE10_MATERIAL_DASHBOARD_CARD_MARKER"
      android:layout_width="match_parent" android:layout_height="wrap_content"
      app:cardCornerRadius="0dp" app:cardBackgroundColor="@android:color/transparent"
      app:cardElevation="0dp" xmlns:app="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res-auto">
    <LinearLayout xmlns:tools="http://schemas.android.com/tools" tools:ignore="HardcodedText,DisableBaselineAlignment,ButtonStyle,UseCompoundDrawables" android:baselineAligned="false"
        android:tag="PHASE10_MATERIAL3_LAYOUT_MARKER"
        android:layout_width="match_parent" android:layout_height="wrap_content"
        android:orientation="vertical" android:padding="24dp">

